WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:15.729
I have come to this building every day and done my job. Three decades I've given to this office.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:24.759
But honestly sometimes it scares me. I don't know what we do here

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:40.620
Have I done something wrong? 
 Someone walked in from the other side. The other side I...  Whatever you do, don't panic.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:47.220
Wai..Wha...Hi Howard

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:54.760
Lee do you have any idea how lucky you are?  No one, No one gets to meet other.  Other?

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.180
Thirty years ago during the Cold War there was an experiment.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:02.440
Something went wrong.  They opened up a passage.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:07.959
When you go through this door you come out the other side. You're in another world identical to ours.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:12.189
There was one reality and then it duplicated.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:18.219
We share genetics, childhood.  I want to know how you became so different.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:21.070
Shhh.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.990
A kill order came out from my side targeting people on your side.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.809
Handle is Baldwin. She's a contract assassin.  Your wife may be her next target.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:41.349
We're caught in the middle of something whether we want to be or not.  We should just build a wall and never come back.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.820
They hate your side for what you've done to ours.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.699
You don't know these people like I do.   They don't tolerate mistakes

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:07.520
The last thing you want is me with nothing left to say.

